pinscan evaluates the TLS-pinning posture of Android apps for authorized
security assessment. It is a posture-evaluation tool, not an interception tool
for third-party traffic. "YinkoShield", "Yinkozi", "EEI", and "Execution
Evidence Infrastructure" are names of Yinkozi Group; this license grants no
permission to use them (see section 6 of the License), and claiming EEI
compatibility requires Yinkozi's authorization.

This repository contains the posture scanner only. The managed runtime used to
scan hardened production apps with active RASP is offered as an authorized
engagement and is not distributed here.

